    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944110/extras/0b42dd7386bf207bb8698e55f4ad9067.avif?t=1649892190\" /></div><br>Do you like beautiful games with jetpack filled action, shooting, rolling, spaceships, and breaking? Jank is no longer following the rules there are too many secrets to uncover for this one robot to work alone.<br><br>Take on a unique experience with a distinctive hand-drawn design and amazing mechanics to pair with it. Immerse yourself in this world while trying to uncover it's many dark sides and your unknown past.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944110/extras/3f84eb28416e0e8fcabec870a5e6b7f0.poster.avif?t=1649892190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944110/extras/3f84eb28416e0e8fcabec870a5e6b7f0.webm?t=1649892190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944110/extras/3f84eb28416e0e8fcabec870a5e6b7f0.mp4?t=1649892190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 different zones with different styles of gameplay with individual levels in each<br></li><li> Different Mechanics: Rolling, Jetpacks, Grappling guns, and more to come!<br></li><li> Flying spaceships<br></li><li> Explore abandoned (or not so abandoned) buildings<br></li><li> Rude lady robot that bosses you around</li></ul>",
